{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"一、元年，春王正月，公即位。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"二、二月辛酉，葬我君宣公。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"三、無冰。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"四、三月，作丘甲。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"何以書？譏。何譏爾？譏始丘使也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"五、夏，臧孫許及晉侯盟于赤棘。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"六、秋，王師敗績于貿戎。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"孰敗之？蓋晉敗之，或曰貿戎敗之。然則曷為不言晉敗之？王者無敵，莫敢當也。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_133_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_133","textTraditional":"七、冬十月。","sentenceOrder":9}],"overrides":{}}